<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Feb 7.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Feb 7.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Friday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day  and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at the close was 3407.22, 4.62 points or 0.14 percent higher than Thursday's close.</p>
